# Development tools (tests, linting, dependency audit, lock-file generation).
# Regenerate the lock file with:
#   uv pip compile requirements-dev.in -c requirements.txt --universal --python-version 3.11 \
#     --generate-hashes --exclude-newer <date 7 days ago> -o requirements-dev.txt
#
# `-c requirements.txt` keeps packages that both files share on the app's pinned version.
# Regenerate this lock whenever requirements.txt changes.
